Hashcode :
 any input it will create an number using these function

 1) we need all elements as positive integer
 2) hashcode that i get is very large (reduce it)=> hashing reduce all elements in size m

 ex: size of array is m = 10
 Integer value return same hashcode (because its unique)
 String value do some internal operation return the value

 "aarthiya" => hashCode("aarthiya") = 734985 (want to insert the size 10 only)
 "ravi"     => hashCode("ravi") = 381347
 "yara"     => hashCode("yara") = 239873

 so , reduce the large number using modulo
 734985 % 10 = 5
 381347 % 10 = 7
 239873 % 10 = 3

 sometimes we get same modulo value.

 ex:
 "rahul" => hashCode("rahul") =  394783
 394783 % 10  = 3

"yara" => hashCode("yara") = 239873
 239873 % 10 = 3

  both have same hashCode value its called collision

